Add a new 3D LUT test to kms_color that validates color transformation
where only the green channel is preserved (R=0, G=1, B=0) using a 17x17x17 LUT.
The LUT is traversed in RGB order and uses tetrahedral interpolation.

The test is useful for verifying GPU hardware's ability to correctly
apply 3D LUT color transformations with isolated channel behavior.

Signed-off-by: Swati Sharma <swati2.sharma@intel.com>
